<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-FEB PPI UP 0.8 PCT MO/MO, 5.3 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-FEB PPI UP 0.8 PCT MO/MO, 5.3 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's producer price index rose by 0.8 percent in February on a month-to-month basis for a 5.3 percent year-on-year rise, the statistics committee said on Friday.</p>
</text>
